#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:-1
msgid "Kdenlive Tips & Tricks - Waveform and RGB Parade"
msgstr "Kdenlive tipy a triky – Waveform a RGB Parade"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:-1
msgid ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, tips, tricks, tips & tricks, scopes, waveform, RGB parade, "
"editing, timeline, documentation, user manual, video editor, open source, "
"free, learn, easy"
msgstr ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, tips, tricks, tips & tricks, scopes, waveform, RGBparade,  "
"editing, timeline, documentation, user manual, video editor,open source,  "
"free, learn, easy"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:34
msgid "Waveform and RGB Parade"
msgstr "Waveform a RGB Parade"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:36
msgid ""
"**Waveform** and **RGB Parade** are two closely related scopes. They do the "
"same - Waveform for :term:`Luma`, RGB Parade for the :abbr:`RGB (Red Green "
"Blue)` components. Therefore, we will not always explicitly point out what "
"properties hold for both scopes and speak of Waveform only."
msgstr ""
"**Waveform** a **RGB Parade** sú dve úzko súvisiace zobrazenia. Robia to "
"isté – Waveform pre :term:`Luma`, RGB Parade pre zložky :abbr:`RGB (Red "
"Green Blue)`. Preto nebudeme vždy výslovne uvádzať, ktoré vlastnosti platia "
"pre obe zobrazenia, a budeme hovoriť iba o Waveform."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:43
msgid "Kdenlive Waveform :term:`widget`"
msgstr "Kdenlive Waveform :term:`widget`"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:47
msgid "How the Waveform Works"
msgstr "Ako funguje Waveform"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:49
msgid ""
"The Waveform is kind of a 3D Histogram. That has nothing to do with the fact "
"that the above image looks kind of 3D. So where are the three dimensions?"
msgstr ""
"Waveform je akýsi 3D histogram. To nemá nič spoločné so skutočnosťou, že "
"obrázok vyššie vyzerá akosi trojdimenzionálne. Kde sú teda tri dimenzie?"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:51
msgid ""
"The most obvious dimension is :term:`Luma`: Dark pixels are at the bottom, "
"bright ones are at the top. So if all pixels in the Waveform stick at the "
"very top, your video is most likely white."
msgstr ""
"Najzrejmejšia dimenzia je :term:`Luma`: tmavé pixely sú dole, svetlé hore. "
"Takže ak všetky pixely vo Waveform lipnú úplne hore, vaše video je s "
"najväčšou pravdepodobnosťou biele."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:53
msgid ""
"The second dimension is the horizontal position of the pixel in the original "
"image. That is one of the things that makes the Waveform cool. Pixels in the "
"first column of your input video will also be painted in the first column of "
"the Waveform. This goes on until the scope reaches the last column of the "
"input video, which will be painted in the last column of the Waveform."
msgstr ""
"Druhá dimenzia je vodorovná poloha pixela v pôvodnom obraze. To je jedna z "
"vecí, ktoré robia Waveform skvelým. Pixely v prvom stĺpci vstupného videa "
"budú tiež nakreslené v prvom stĺpci Waveform. Toto pokračuje, kým zobrazenie "
"nedosiahne posledný stĺpec vstupného videa, ktorý bude nakreslený v "
"poslednom stĺpci Waveform."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:55
msgid ""
"The third dimension is the brightness of a pixel in the Waveform. The "
"brighter a point there, the more pixels in this column share this specific "
"brightness value."
msgstr ""
"Tretia dimenzia je jas pixela vo Waveform. Čím jasnejší je bod, tým viac "
"pixelov v tomto stĺpci zdieľa túto konkrétnu hodnotu jasu."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:58
msgid "Waveform Example 1: Sunset"
msgstr "Waveform príklad 1: Západ slnka"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:65
msgid "Waveform example 1"
msgstr "Waveform príklad 1"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:67
msgid ""
"The Waveform looks quite impressive here. But what can we learn about the "
"image?"
msgstr "Waveform tu vyzerá dosť pôsobivo. Ale čo sa môžeme dozvedieť o obraze?"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:69
msgid ""
"In the left third we have got some clipping. There are some bright spots "
"which are the sun and the clouds."
msgstr ""
"V ľavej tretine máme nejaké orezanie. Sú tu niektoré svetlé miesta, ktorými "
"sú slnko a mraky."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:71
msgid ""
"The last third of the image is dark, but not black (no crushing). This means "
"that there is still a chance for color information. The image confirms that: "
"The tree does not look neutral but green with an orange touch. Or is it the "
"other way round?"
msgstr ""
"Posledná tretina obrazu je tmavá, ale nie čierna (bez drvenia). To znamená, "
"že stále existuje šanca na farebné informácie. Obraz to potvrdzuje: strom "
"nevyzerá neutrálne, ale zelene s oranžovým nádychom. Alebo je to naopak?"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:73
msgid "That is where the RGB Parade drops in now."
msgstr "To je miesto, kde teraz vstupuje RGB Parade."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:80
msgid "Kdenlive RGB Parade :term:`widget`"
msgstr "Kdenlive RGB Parade :term:`widget`"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:82
msgid ""
"What we see is very slight crushing for blue on the tree, and more or less "
"equal parts of red and green as well. So if you thought the tree were green, "
"your brain fooled you. It is not. (Actually there is no green at all in the "
"image.) Also, blue nearly does not clip at all, even in the sun. So it is "
"still a little bit orange, which is great."
msgstr ""
"Vidíme veľmi mierne drvenie pre modrú na strome, a viac-menej rovnaké časti "
"červenej a zelenej tiež. Takže ak ste si mysleli, že strom je zelený, váš "
"mozog vás oklamal. Nie je. (V skutočnosti v obraze nie je vôbec žiadna "
"zelená.) Tiež modrá takmer vôbec neorezáva, dokonca ani na slnku. Takže je "
"stále trochu oranžová, čo je skvelé."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:84
msgid ""
"Now, did the Histogram not show clipping and crushing as well? Yes, it did. "
"But it did not show where. That is a big benefit. As in some cases, if you "
"see that there is some clipping on a light bulb, you perhaps do not mind "
"increasing the overall brightness of the image. It does increase clipping as "
"seen on the Histogram, but the Waveform shows that only the light bulb is "
"clipped a little more, which you can afford in our imaginary case."
msgstr ""
"Teraz, nezobrazoval histogram tiež orezanie a drvenie? Áno, zobrazoval. Ale "
"neukázal kde. To je veľká výhoda. Pretože v niektorých prípadoch, ak vidíte, "
"že je nejaké orezanie na žiarovke, možno vám nevadí zvýšenie celkového jasu "
"obrazu. Zvyšuje to orezanie, ako vidno na histograme, ale Waveform ukazuje, "
"že iba žiarovka je mierne orezaná, čo si v našom hypotetíckom prípade môžeme "
"dovoliť."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:87
msgid "RGB Parade Example: Light Bulb"
msgstr "Príklad RGB Parade: Žiarovka"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:89
msgid ""
"Wait … imaginary? Actually there is a short clip with light bulbs. Which is "
"quite interesting, not only due to the wrong white balance. See the how-to "
"guide :doc:`/tips_and_tricks/how-tos/tutorial-white_balance_lms` for more "
"details about white balance and how to use it in Kdenlive."
msgstr ""
"Počkajte… hypotetický? V skutočnosti existuje krátky klip so žiarovkami. Čo "
"je dosť zaujímavé, nielen kvôli nesprávnej vyváženiu bielej. Pozrite si "
"príručku :doc:`/tips_and_tricks/how-tos/tutorial-white_balance_lms` pre viac "
"podrobností o vyvážení bielej a o tom, ako ho použiť v Kdenlive."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:96
msgid "RGB Parade example 1"
msgstr "RGB Parade príklad 1"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:98
msgid ""
"The RGB Parade reveals two things at first glance. You will at least "
"recognize the first one as well."
msgstr ""
"RGB Parade odhaľuje na prvý pohľad dve veci. Aspoň tú prvú spoznáte tiež."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:100
msgid ""
"The fluorescent lamps are clipped. All channels are at 255 there, so they "
"are totally white."
msgstr ""
"Žiarivkové lampy sú orezané. Všetky kanály sú tam na 255, takže sú úplne "
"biele."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:102
msgid ""
"The white balance is wrong. This can be told for sure. The ceiling is white "
"in reality. And the left-most quarter of the image consists exclusively of "
"the ceiling. This part should look equal in the RGB Parade, but when e.g. "
"comparing Red to Blue, you see that Red starts at 19 whereas Blue starts at "
"0. Furthermore, the Blue channel is much more compressed. Its height in this "
"area is 25, whereas the height of the Red channel is about 50."
msgstr ""
"Vyváženie bielej je nesprávne. To možno povedať s istotou. Strop je v "
"skutočnosti biely. A úplne ľavá štvrtina obrazu pozostáva výlučne zo stropu. "
"Táto časť by mala vyzerať rovnako v RGB Parade, ale napríklad pri porovnaní "
"červenej s modrou vidíte, že červená začína na 19, zatiaľ čo modrá začína na "
"0. Okrem toho je modrý kanál oveľa viac komprimovaný. Jeho výška v tejto "
"oblasti je 25, zatiaľ čo výška červeného kanála je asi 50."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:104
msgid ""
"To achieve proper white balance here we make use of a new effect called :doc:"
"`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/sat`. :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves` would work "
"as well (actually curves could do everything), but let's use a new effect "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Na dosiahnutie správneho vyváženia bielej tu použijeme nový efekt s názvom :"
"doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/sat`. :doc:`/"
"effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/curves` by tiež "
"fungoval (krivky dokážu vlastne všetko), ale použijeme tu nový efekt."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:106
msgid ""
"The first thing to decide is how bright the darkest spot should be. This can "
"be controlled with the :guilabel:`Offset` parameter. Reference is again the "
"left part of the Parades, the soon-to-be white ceiling. You can use your "
"mouse to make the Waveform or RGB Parade draw a horizontal line and display "
"the value there. All channels were lifted to around 50 in this example:"
msgstr ""
"Prvá vec, o ktorej treba rozhodnúť, je to, ako jasné by malo byť najtmavšie "
"miesto. To možno kontrolovať parametrom :guilabel:`Offset`. Referenciou je "
"opäť ľavá časť Parades, čoskoro biely strop. Myšou môžete nechať Waveform "
"alebo RGB Parade nakresliť vodorovnú čiaru a zobraziť tam hodnotu. Všetky "
"kanály boli v tomto príklade zdvihnuté na asi 50:"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:109
msgid ""
"The :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/sat` "
"uses a different scale than the RGP Parade :term:`widget`. The lifting of "
"the channels refers to the RGB Parade scale (0...255) as one can see in the :"
"guilabel:`Min` in the RGB Parade display. The idea is to lift the channels "
"so that their bottoms are aligned."
msgstr ""
":doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/sat` používa "
"iná škálu než widget :term:`widget` RGP Parade. Zdvíhanie kanálov sa "
"vzťahuje na škálu RGB Parade (0...255), ako vidno v :guilabel:`Min` v "
"zobrazení RGB Parade. Myšlienkou je zdvihnúť kanály tak, aby ich spodné "
"časti boli zarovnané."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:116
msgid ""
"Using the :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/"
"sat` to change the color tone"
msgstr ""
"Použitie :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/"
"sat` na zmenu farebného tónu"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:118
msgid ""
"Second step is stretching the channels. This is done with the :guilabel:"
"`Slope` sliders. The goal is again to find a neutral spot in the RGB Parade "
"and use it as reference. We could again use the ceiling on the left, but "
"after some testing it turned out that the little wave in the middle of the "
"scope works as well. Its advantage is that it is slightly brighter than the "
"ceiling allowing to correct the color cast more precisely."
msgstr ""
"Druhý krok je natiahnutie kanálov. To sa vykonáva pomocou posuvníkov :"
"guilabel:`Slope`. Cieľom je opäť nájsť neutrálne miesto v RGB Parade a "
"použiť ho ako referenciu. Mohli by sme opäť použiť strop vľavo, ale po "
"nejakom testovaní sa ukázalo, že malá vlna v strede zobrazenia tiež funguje. "
"Jej výhodou je, že je mierne jasnejšia ako strop, čo umožňuje presnejšie "
"korigovať farebný odtieň."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:125
msgid ""
"Using the :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/"
"sat` to adjust white balance"
msgstr ""
"Použitie :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/"
"sat` na nastavenie vyváženia bielej"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:127
msgid "And voilà, exposure and white balance are corrected."
msgstr "A voilà, expozícia a vyváženie bielej sú opravené."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:129
msgid ""
"When taking a look at the full-sized image (or when trying it yourself with "
"the sample clip available for download at the end of this article) you will "
"notice color waves in the image. This is the result of the stretching: We "
"have blown up the ceiling on the left from 25px height to nearly 100px. If "
"the clip had been exposured and white-balanced correctly when shooting, we "
"would have 100 distinct values there, but now there are only 25 different "
"blue levels causing these steps. Also in the histogram the image looks torn "
"apart. (Another reason might be the high compression of the Nikon D90 "
"clips.) This effect is called *Posterization*\\ [#f1]_."
msgstr ""
"Pri pohľade na obrázok v plnej veľkosti (alebo keď to skúšate sami s "
"ukážkovým klipom dostupným na stiahnutie na konci tohto článku) si všimnete "
"farebné vlny v obraze. Toto je výsledok natiahnutia: Strop vľavo sme nafúkli "
"z výšky 25px na takmer 100px. Keby bol klip pri nakrúcaní správne exponovaný "
"a vyvážený na bielu, mali by sme tam 100 odlišných hodnôt, ale teraz je iba "
"25 rôznych úrovní modrej spôsobujúcich tieto kroky. Aj v histograme vyzerá "
"obraz roztrhaný. (Ďalším dôvodom môže byť vysoká kompresia klipov Nikon "
"D90.) Tento efekt sa nazýva *Posterizácia*\\ [#f1]_."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:131
msgid ""
"This is one of the reasons why more expensive cameras (and with that we mean "
"*really* expensive ones, like the *RED One*\\ [#f2]_, to name an extreme "
"example) record videos in higher bit depth\\ [#f3]_. Perhaps all clips you "
"will ever encounter only store 8 bits per channel, so there are 2\\ :sup:`8` "
"= 256 possible values for each channel. Having for example 10 bits per "
"channel would already result in 2\\ :sup:`10` = 1024 possible values. This "
"would already have solved our problem."
msgstr ""
"To je jeden z dôvodov, prečo drahšie kamery (a tým myslíme *naozaj* drahé, "
"ako napríklad *RED One*\\ [#f2]_, aby sme uviedli extrémny príklad) "
"nahrávajú videá vo vyššej bitovej hĺbke\\ [#f3]_. Možno všetky klipy, s "
"ktorými sa stretnete, ukladajú iba 8 bitov na kanál, takže existuje 2\\ :sup:"
"`8` = 256 možných hodnôt pre každý kanál. Mať napríklad 10 bitov na kanál by "
"už viedlo k 2\\ :sup:`10` = 1024 možným hodnotám. To by náš problém už "
"vyriešilo."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:133
msgid ""
"But before you buy a *RED One* now - Kdenlive does not support more than 8 "
"bit (yet)."
msgstr ""
"Ale predtým, než si teraz kúpite *RED One* – Kdenlive (zatiaľ) nepodporuje "
"viac ako 8 bitov."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:135
msgid ""
"Where you already can play with more than 8 bits per channel are :abbr:`RAW "
"(The RAW file format is digital photography's equivalent of a negative in "
"film photography: it contains untouched, raw pixel information straight from "
"the digital camera's sensor)` images from :abbr:`DSLR (DSLR stands for "
"Digital Single-Lens Reflex)` cameras. Supported by many image processing "
"applications such as |digikam| or |rawtherapee|."
msgstr ""
"Kde už môžete pracovať s viac ako 8 bitmi na kanál, sú obrázky :abbr:`RAW "
"(Formát súboru RAW je digitálnym ekvivalentom negatívu vo filmovej "
"fotografii: obsahuje nedotknuté, surové informácie o pixeloch priamo zo "
"snímača digitálneho fotoaparátu)` z fotoaparátov :abbr:`DSLR (DSLR je "
"skratka pre Digital Single-Lens Reflex)`. Podporované mnohými aplikáciami na "
"spracovanie obrazu, ako napríklad |digikam| alebo |rawtherapee|."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:138
msgid "Waveform Example 2: Leaf with Hidden Clipping"
msgstr "Waveform príklad 2: List so skrytým orezaním"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:145
msgid "Waveform example 2"
msgstr "Waveform príklad 2"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:147
msgid ""
"Looks perfect. Good exposure (says the eye and the Waveform), beautiful "
"colors."
msgstr ""
"Vyzerá perfektne. Dobrá expozícia (hovorí oko aj Waveform), krásne farby."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:149
msgid ""
"Nevertheless, there is some clipping. It is just hidden by the Luma "
"calculation: For Luma, only pixels that are totally white are at the top of "
"the Waveform."
msgstr ""
"Napriek tomu je tu nejaké orezanie. Je len skryté výpočtom Luma: pre Luma sú "
"na vrchole Waveform iba pixely, ktoré sú úplne biele."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:156
msgid "RGB Parade exposes clipping"
msgstr "RGB Parade odhaľuje orezanie"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:158
msgid ""
"Although the green leaf looks much brighter than the red tip, it is the Red "
"channel which clips at the tips. The thing is that our eyes are most "
"sensitive to Green, less to Red, and even less to Blue. That is also the "
"reason why the beam of a green laser is visible in the night sky, but a red "
"one is not - unless you've got a really strong one."
msgstr ""
"Hoci zelený list vyzerá oveľa jasnejší ako červený hrot, práve červený kanál "
"orezáva na hrotoch. Problém je v tom, že naše oči sú najcitlivejšie na "
"zelenú, menej na červenú a ešte menej na modrú. To je tiež dôvod, prečo je "
"lúč zeleného lasera viditeľný na nočnej oblohe, ale červený nie – pokiaľ "
"nemáte naozaj silný."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:161
msgid "Waveform Example 3: High Key Clip"
msgstr "Waveform príklad 3: Klip High Key"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:168
msgid "Waveform example 3"
msgstr "Waveform príklad 3"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:170
msgid ""
"This is a classical |high_key| shot. Bright subject (but not clipped yet), "
"white background."
msgstr ""
"Toto je klasický záber |high_key|. Svetlý objekt (ale zatiaľ neorezaný), "
"biele pozadie."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:173
msgid "Waveform Options"
msgstr "Možnosti Waveform"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:175
msgid ""
"*Paint Mode* - Changes the paint mode for the Waveform. Usually changes its "
"brightness as well. Green also highlights pixels with values 0 or 255."
msgstr ""
"*Režim kreslenia* – Mení režim kreslenia pre Waveform. Zvyčajne tiež mení "
"jeho jas. Zelená tiež zvýrazňuje pixely s hodnotami 0 alebo 255."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:177
msgid ""
"*Luma mode* (Context menu) - As for the Histogram you can choose how to "
"calculate Luma (Rec.601 or Rec.709)."
msgstr ""
"*Režim Luma* (kontextové menu) – Rovnako ako pre histogram môžete zvoliť "
"spôsob výpočtu Luma (Rec.601 alebo Rec.709)."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:184
msgid "Waveform :term:`widget` with paint mode Green"
msgstr "Waveform :term:`widget` s režimom kreslenia Zelená"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:186
msgid ""
"Interesting detail: When color grading, some colorists prefer scopes with "
"neutral colors and basically with neutral everything. Just greyscale except "
"for the video itself. Why is that? Quick answer and fun fact: |afterimages|. "
"If you look at a green surface and then immediately color grade an image by "
"eye, there will be too much green in it."
msgstr ""
"Zaujímavý detail: Pri farebnom gradovaní niektorí coloristi uprednostňujú "
"zobrazenia s neutrálnymi farbami a v podstate s neutrálnym všetkým. Iba "
"odtiene šedej, okrem samotného videa. Prečo je to tak? Rýchla odpoveď a "
"zaujímavý fakt: |afterimages|. Ak sa pozriete na zelenú plochu a potom ihneď "
"farebne gradujete obraz od oka, bude v ňom príliš veľa zelenej."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:189
msgid "RGB Parade Options"
msgstr "Možnosti RGB Parade"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:191
msgid "*Paint Mode* - Changes the paint mode; see above."
msgstr "*Režim kreslenia* – Mení režim kreslenia; pozri vyššie."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:193
msgid "*Draw Axis* (Context menu) - Draws an axis with 10 steps"
msgstr "*Kresliť os* (kontextové menu) – Nakreslí os s 10 krokmi"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:195
msgid ""
"*Gradient reference line* (Context menu) - Draws a line from bottom left to "
"top right. This is useful when testing color correction on a linear gradient "
"clip (Black on the left, White on the right), to observe changes in each "
"channels."
msgstr ""
"*Referenčná čiara gradientu* (kontextové menu) – Nakreslí čiaru od spodného "
"ľavého rohu po horný pravý roh. To je užitočné pri testovaní farebnej "
"korekcie na klipe s lineárnym gradientom (čierna vľavo, biela vpravo), aby "
"bolo možné sledovať zmeny v každom kanáli."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:197
msgid ""
"To explain the last point a little more in detail: A black/white gradient "
"draws a line from the bottom left to top right on the Waveform. When "
"changing the colors, e.g. with the :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"color_image_correction/sat` effect or with :doc:`/effects_and_filters/"
"video_effects/color_image_correction/curves`, the line will change."
msgstr ""
"Aby sme posledný bod trochu podrobnejšie vysvetlili: čierno-biely gradient "
"nakreslí čiaru od spodného ľavého po horný pravý roh Waveform. Pri zmene "
"farieb, napr. pomocou efektu :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"color_image_correction/sat` alebo pomocou :doc:`/effects_and_filters/"
"video_effects/color_image_correction/curves`, sa čiara zmení."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:200
msgid ""
"Effects working on the saturation will not have any effect on a grayscale "
"gradient!"
msgstr ""
"Efekty pracujúce so sýtosťou nebudú mať žiadny efekt na gradient v odtieňoch "
"šedej!"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:207
msgid ""
"Playing with the :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"color_image_correction/sat` and a gradient"
msgstr ""
"Hranie sa s :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/color_image_correction/"
"sat` a gradientom"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:209
msgid ""
"In this gradient above a :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"color_image_correction/sat` effect was applied to give the blacks a blueish "
"touch and the mids and highs a warm touch. You can play around with the "
"gradient file and some color correction effects on the gradient file as "
"well. What the above is good for will be in the next part."
msgstr ""
"V tomto gradiente vyššie bol aplikovaný efekt :doc:`/effects_and_filters/"
"video_effects/color_image_correction/sat`, aby sa čiernym dal modrý nádych a "
"stredným a svetlým tónom teplý nádych. Môžete sa tiež pohrať so súborom "
"gradientu a niektorými efektmi farebnej korekcie na súbore gradientu. Na čo "
"je to vyššie uvedené dobré, bude v ďalšej časti."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:213
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Súhrn"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/scopes/waveform_and_rgb_parade.rst:214
msgid ""
"**Waveform** and **RGB Parade** are powerful scopes. Especially the RGB "
"Parade. Correcting the exposure is easy, and with these scopes you can "
"always keep track of the levels of each color component. It is also possible "
"to do white balance by adjusting blacks first and whites afterwards because "
"the horizontal axis in the Scopes correspond to the horizontal axis in the "
"video which allows to detect spots that should be neutral."
msgstr ""
"**Waveform** a **RGB Parade** sú výkonné zobrazenia. Najmä RGB Parade. "
"Oprava expozície je jednoduchá a pomocou týchto zobrazení môžete vždy "
"sledovať úrovne každej farebnej zložky. Je tiež možné vykonať vyváženie "
"bielej úpravou čiernych najprv a bielych potom, pretože vodorovná os v "
"zobrazeniach zodpovedá vodorovnej osi vo videu, čo umožňuje detekovať "
"miesta, ktoré by mali byť neutrálne."

